["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Helen Duncan ectoplasm teleplasm materialization medium Vagrancy Act Witchcraft Act 1735 Fraudulent Mediums Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-stuffmissed-她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没-英国用巫术法让她闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没，英国用巫术法让她闭嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">检察官当庭声明这与巫术无关，纯属诈骗，但真正促使动用1735年巫术法的，是她曾说中两艘英国军舰的沉没，军方担心她在诺曼底登陆前走漏消息。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灵媒诈骗</span><span class=\"tag\">二战谍报</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dan Williams on Why AI (Probably) Won’t Kill Us AI as Normal Technology stochastic parrots NIMBY post-training conflict entrepreneurs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-goodfight-大语言模型其实是社交媒体的反面-而非升级版/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>大语言模型其实是社交媒体的反面，而非升级版</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社交媒体靠算法放大耸动内容拉低公共讨论，目前的ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini甚至Grok却默认追求准确克制——但这优势未必持久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">虚假信息</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Fix Professional Networking? | Inside Cosign MCP coincidence of intent golden handcuffs agent-to-agent protocol\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-a16z-领英永远不会做的事-开放一张可搜索的人脉信任图谱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>领英永远不会做的事：开放一张可搜索的人脉信任图谱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 押注的 Cosign 认为，招聘的下一步不是海投简历，而是你信任的人——未来甚至是你的 AI agent——替你做第一轮筛选。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1370: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin clade 2.3.4.4B seroconversion ELISpot assay TH1/TH2 response post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-twiv-佛罗里达若废除入学强制接种-模型预测五年内数百儿童将死于麻疹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>佛罗里达若废除入学强制接种，模型预测五年内数百儿童将死于麻疹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用数学模型测算，取消学校强制接种疫苗的要求将在佛罗里达引发近半个世纪来美国最大规模麻疹疫情，五年内数百名儿童和婴儿可能因此死亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">禽流感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡ Building ChatGPT for Finance — Joseph Kim, OpenAI&#x27;s Head of Financial Services MCP RLHF reward model readability GDP eval\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-现成数据接口错误率超40-逼得openai自建数据管道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">27:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>现成数据接口错误率超40%，逼得OpenAI自建数据管道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">测试发现部分知名MCP数据连接器错误率超40%，促使OpenAI放弃直接调用插件，转而自建数据管道作为金融产品的核心竞争力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企业产品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic S-1 Shocker, Greatest Business Ever? Google&#x27;s $500B Wipeout, Midterm Predictions S-1 convertible notes recursive self-improvement (RSI) Vickrey auction ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-allin-anthropic800亿美元亏损是假账-实际烧钱不到100亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8f622bd4f103f10-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic800亿美元亏损是假账，实际烧钱不到100亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那800亿亏损来自给亚马逊等基础设施伙伴发的可转换票据——估值越涨账面亏损越大，但钱从没真花出去，实际总烧钱只有90亿到100亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">AI估值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Future of Financial Advice: Masters in Business with Rich Steinmeier RIA wire house non-compete transition assistance ERISA 40-30-30 portfolio\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-mastersinbiz-没有竞业协议-顾问随时能走-这家万亿资管公司流失率却最低/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>没有竞业协议、顾问随时能走，这家万亿资管公司流失率却最低</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LPL的顾问是独立老板，没有竞业协议，想走就走，LPL甚至帮他们带走客户资料，逼着自己每天重新赢得信任，流失率因此远低于行业的5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">独立顾问模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Can Build Software RSI vibe coding Lindy effect PLG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-ycsp-数据库公司七成新增用量来自ai代理-不是人类工程师/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30dacdc60410d57c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>数据库公司七成新增用量来自AI代理，不是人类工程师</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">各行各业的人不再需要说服工程师才能动手：AI让懂业务的人直接建出复杂系统，这个新建造者群体的增长目前看不到天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">开发者工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Was I wrong about open models &amp; cyber risks? open-weight model offense-defense balance sigmoid ClickFix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-interconnects-被渲染成网络武器的开源模型发布后-世界并没有崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e4c5ea11768e1209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>被渲染成网络武器的开源模型发布后，世界并没有崩溃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开源模型跨过了被认为的网络武器门槛一个多月，没有证据显示发生了质变级灾难，但作者承认这仍将是一场代价不低的行业被迫升级。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Caro – The master biographer reflects at 91 eminent domain majority leader\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-dwarkesh-写权力如何腐化人的传记作家说-美国建不成东西-是矫枉过正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/210def115ef0731e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>写权力如何腐化人的传记作家说：美国建不成东西，是矫枉过正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说如今的环评、社区委员会和诉讼并不比摩西那个年代的建设障碍少；真正稀缺的，是愿意想办法绕开一切阻力把事情做成的那种人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基建</span><span class=\"tag\">权力与治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley Walks the Jagged Edge jagged edge RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) bullwhip effect golden path structurally short\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-asianometry-想做多算力-光囤芯片不够-不借钱加仓就是-结构性做空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de22d2d519cce16c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">18:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>想做多算力，光囤芯片不够：不借钱加仓就是「结构性做空」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人向作者解释，光靠融资买够算力已经不算真正「做多」——还得借债加仓芯片，否则就是在「结构性做空」自己，这是硅谷圈内流传的一句玩笑话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体设备</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Could Turn Small Law Firms Into Billion-Dollar Businesses contingency (law) plaintiff law cause of action ADR (automated dispute resolution) long horizon agents\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-a16z-小型律所靠ai也能做到十亿美元生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>小型律所靠AI也能做到十亿美元生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">原告律师的瓶颈从来不是案源而是人力：洛杉矶一家律所用AI把人均客户量从100做到500，这才是法律AI真正的市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI应用层</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Opens the Kimono, Bubble Questions and Frontier Costs, Q&amp;A on Meta, Starlink, Brewers S1 neoclouds Starshield benefit corporation aggregator of aggregators circular financing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-sharptech-anthropic的800亿美元-亏损-只是一场会计幻觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的800亿美元「亏损」只是一场会计幻觉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这笔钱是亚马逊可转换贷款随估值重新计价产生的账面差额，没有现金流出；真正该担心的是训练成本的增速已经超过服务成本，且完全不受自己控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"“Everyone Else Has One”: What Your Kid’s Envy Is Really Telling You SIREN benign envy / malicious envy 시기 (Shigi) 부러워 (Puro) 장손 (Jangson)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-raisinggh-孩子吵着要iphone-其实要的是不被排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/071e8b2d9bfabca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>孩子吵着要iPhone,其实要的是不被排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社会学家 Stacy Kim 说嫉妒本身是中性信号：你只会嫉妒离你够近、你也真正在意的人，学会不盯着对方而是追问感受本身，才能把嫉妒变成行动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嫉妒心理</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"PHP2Shell Won&#x27;t Be the Last Big AI Cybersecurity Risk minus one-day vulnerability centaur hacker formal verification Pass the Planet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-oddlots-已知两年没人能利用的php漏洞-ai一天写出了攻击代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>已知两年没人能利用的PHP漏洞，AI一天写出了攻击代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">PHP基金会两年前就知道这个漏洞，却因为没人能证明能利用它而搁置未修；AI一天内就写出了远程攻陷网站的完整攻击代码。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WHOOP CEO, Will Ahmed: 50B Hours of Health Data, a 4 Million Member Data Moat, &amp; the FDA Fight HRV GLP-1 AFib 510(k) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-allin-血压监测算健康产品不算医疗器械-whoop硬刚fda赢了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/157d273f0c076aa6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>血压监测算健康产品不算医疗器械，Whoop硬刚FDA赢了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whoop坚持把血压监测算作健康功能而非医疗器械，顶住FDA一封警告信，最终促成FDA更新审批指南，血压功能至今仍留在产品里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可穿戴设备</span><span class=\"tag\">订阅制转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What I learned about power from LBJ and Robert Moses public authority unanimous consent agreement YIMBY\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-dwarkesh-没人选他-他却靠法案里一句话把权力焊进了宪法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c00f9336512a8100-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">24:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>没人选他，他却靠法案里一句话把权力焊进了宪法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗伯特·摩斯从未当选任何公职，却把征收通行费、留存盈余的权力写进了债券合同——美国宪法保护合同不可侵犯，这一招让他的权力比任何市长、州长的任期都更难撼动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">权力</span><span class=\"tag\">政治操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luke Muehlhauser on the most important AI safety work nobody is doing TEDAI neuralese reward hacking focused research organizations impact investing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-eightythousand-ai安全圈不缺钱-缺的是愿意辞职去当创始人的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c28893c5b3ed220c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:36:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全圈不缺钱，缺的是愿意辞职去当创始人的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">资金不是AI安全的瓶颈——会审查申请、愿意辞职创业去填补「AI的FDA」「AI的NTSB」这类机构空白的人，才是真正稀缺的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善资助</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Preparing for a Career During in Age of Artificial Intelligence prestige trap case method experiential learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-mastersinbiz-哈佛商学院前院长-学生该做的不是用ai-是跟ai辩论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ceeab3e81fd72a7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">15:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>哈佛商学院前院长：学生该做的不是用AI，是跟AI辩论</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他要求学生在课堂上大声读出AI给的答案，再说清楚哪里同意、哪里反对——这种带着审问的协作，才是AI时代真正能带进职场的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI与就业</span><span class=\"tag\">批判性思维</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Startups Rebuilding American Industry | The AD50 dual use valley of death co-engineering low mix high volume / high mix low volume AD50 manufacturing middle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-a16z-国防订单替美国工厂买单-受益的将是机器人和医疗设备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>国防订单替美国工厂买单，受益的将是机器人和医疗设备</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">国防合同替美国工厂矿山买单最贵的开厂成本，这些产能和工艺最终流向机器人、能源电网和消费品，而不只是武器本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">先进制造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Software engineering at Google &amp; CS education with Titus Winters Abseil AST readability review OpenRewrite zero token architecture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-pragmatic-ai真正价值不是把活干得更快-而是去做以前想都不敢想的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3f9c9068b7bc84b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI真正价值不是把活干得更快，而是去做以前想都不敢想的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现有生产力指标只会统计代码行数和故障率，却量不出团队借AI啃下了一件以前觉得不值得、做不到的更难任务，这才是Titus Winters认为AI价值被低估的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Google工程文化</span><span class=\"tag\">大规模代码重构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Taking on ServiceNow: Coding Agents the Rest of Us with Serval Co-Founder and CEO Jake Stauch TAM SDLC vibe coding ITSM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-nopriors-ai-智能体越聪明-大企业反而把权限收得更紧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b4599cbd3b872acf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能体越聪明，大企业反而把权限收得更紧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jake Stauch 认为模型越强，权限滥用能造成的破坏就越大，企业只能把默认权限收到最小，再靠一层审批系统放行例外——这正是 Serval 要卖的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">编码智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How Do You Take a Picture of a Black Hole? VLBI (Very Long Baseline Interferometry) event horizon black hole mimicker frame dragging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-thejoyofwhy-银河系自己的黑洞太活跃-第一张黑洞照片拍的是更远的m87/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b36fc769727aa196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Joy of Why</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>银河系自己的黑洞太活跃，第一张黑洞照片拍的是更远的M87</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">银河系中心黑洞质量小、物质绕转周期只有半小时，一夜之内形貌就会变；M87黑洞重达60亿太阳质量，同一夜观测里几乎静止，反而更容易成像。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">天文观测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Conversation With The Wealthy Barber (Dave Chilton) | #433 RRSP TFSA RESP AUM model segregated fund RRSP meltdown strategy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-rationalreminder-自动储蓄的人不是以后才快乐-而是现在就更快乐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>自动储蓄的人不是以后才快乐，而是现在就更快乐</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做了40年理财教育之后，《The Wealthy Barber》作者发现：强制自动储蓄不是用现在的克制换未来的安稳，而是让人当下就更少焦虑、更快乐——延迟满足的传统说法反而讲反了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span><span class=\"tag\">金融顾问</span>\n</div></div></a>"]